  "story": {
    "title": "The New Road",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Chapansi and her best friend Luano love collecting inswa.",
      "They love to play on the old dirt road... ....even if Mama would tsk-tsk because the stones hurt her feet.",
      "One day, big cars arrive. Mama calls them Caterpillars.",
      "They cover the road in black stuff. Mama calls it tar.",
      "The road is smooth now. Like walking on a mattress!",
      "But when Chapansi and Luano go to the road to catch inswa...",
      "... they only catch three!",
      "Chapansi used to love playing chiyato with Luano.",
      "But there are no more stones on the road to play with.",
      "Chapansi is worried. What if the inswa can’t breathe anymore?",
      "Chapansi kicks the road!",
      "Chapansi goes to Mama.",
      "‘Don’t be sad, my child. Inswa will always find a way out,’ she says.",
      "One rainy day, Luano comes running to Chapansi’s house. ‘Inswa is back!’",
      "Inswa is back! It defeated the road! Mama was right after all!"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Chapansi and her best friend Luano love collecting inswa.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chapansi và người bạn thân nhất của cô bé là Luano rất thích đi bắt inswa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They love to play on the old dirt road...",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn ấy thích chơi trên con đường đất cũ..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "....even if Mama would tsk-tsk because the stones hurt her feet.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "...dù mẹ có \"chậc chậc\" (tiếng mẹ không hài lòng) vì đá làm đau chân mẹ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day, big cars arrive.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, những chiếc xe lớn đến."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Mama calls them Caterpillars.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ gọi chúng là xe \"Caterpillars\"."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They cover the road in black stuff.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng phủ lên đường một thứ màu đen."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Mama calls it tar.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ gọi nó là nhựa đường."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The road is smooth now.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con đường bây giờ thật bằng phẳng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Like walking on a mattress!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cứ như đi trên một tấm nệm vậy!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But when Chapansi and Luano go to the road to catch inswa...",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng khi Chapansi và Luano ra đường để bắt inswa..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "... they only catch three!",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "...họ chỉ bắt được ba con thôi!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chapansi used to love playing chiyato with Luano.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chapansi từng rất thích chơi trò chiyato với Luano."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But there are no more stones on the road to play with.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng không còn đá trên đường để chơi nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chapansi is worried.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chapansi lo lắng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "What if the inswa can’t breathe anymore?",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sẽ ra sao nếu inswa không thể thở được nữa?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chapansi kicks the road!",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chapansi đá vào con đường!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chapansi goes to Mama.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chapansi đến gặp mẹ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Don’t be sad, my child.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "'Đừng buồn, con yêu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Inswa will always find a way out,’ she says.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Inswa sẽ luôn tìm được lối thoát thôi,' mẹ nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One rainy day, Luano comes running to Chapansi’s house.",
        "paragraph_index": 13,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày mưa, Luano chạy đến nhà Chapansi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Inswa is back!’",
        "paragraph_index": 13,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "'Inswa đã trở lại rồi!'"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Inswa is back!",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Inswa đã trở lại!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It defeated the road!",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó đã đánh bại con đường!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Mama was right after all!",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109632/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cuối cùng thì mẹ đã đúng!"
      }
    ]
  },
